Recorded sample sources (tools/samples.py)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No audio file is redistributed in this repository. `tools/samples.manifest.json`
carries the URL, sha256 and licence of every file; `python3 tools/samples.py fetch`
downloads and indexes them into `../out/samples-cache/` at build time. Styles opt in
with a `samples.json` map; without the cache the score falls back to synthesis.

